# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character `—` (tiret cadratin) or en dash `–` in UI copy, docs, comments, commit messages, landing pages, or canvases.

Use a normal hyphen `-`, a colon `:`, parentheses, or rephrase the sentence instead.

Examples:
- Bad: `Aquerty Stop — Timer`
- Good: `Aquerty Stop - Timer`
- Bad: `Acheter Pro à vie — 9,99 €`
- Good: `Acheter Pro à vie - 9,99 €`
